Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Disaster Begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly a disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Wolffy is doing now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this so dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My head hurts so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,where am i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put such a sloppy rag doll here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, he woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and scolded me when he woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on? The rag doll is talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they all wool toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are woolen dolls everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened to my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I turned into a stuffed toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream? Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke our mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, calm down. He must have broken his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So it’s a little abnormal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be tolerant, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.66,0:01:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up quickly, wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then keep an eye on him and don’t let him run around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much. It seems like I’m not dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So it’s all because of that shadow man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Weslie should be in this world too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find Weslie quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be starving
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can rag dolls be hungry too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, meals should always come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.14,0:02:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your food is this cotton?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can actually eat it and it tastes good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one looks more delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So unpalatable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it’s a stool
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Bulala processed into food is delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Where can I eat processed Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so stingy and give me so little?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called exquisiteness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you the rest of the Bulala. Eat it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This meal is so stressful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Soft and slippery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect that a small Bulala could make such delicious food
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course in Bulala City
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to processing Bulala into food, people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,can make them into anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can make a house
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,gardening
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really a magical place
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really a magical place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hospitality. I’m going to find my friend Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for Weslie? Why didn’t you tell me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,do you know weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the microphone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,dad dad dad
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was at the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Where is the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,right there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really not a Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Weslie from Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So your name is Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t look at it. This is just a place to store Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we want to feel the touch of you rare Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve looked through the books and there’s no record of this kind of Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bulala smells really good. Just smelling it makes you feel like you will live longer for several years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be in the storage room for this rare Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I originally thought the fire burn Bulala or
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,thunder and lightning Bulala are already very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s nothing compared to this Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it a pity to offer such a rare Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we take it home and collect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at your potential, of course we will dedicate him to Master Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if Master Quan is happy, we can even become generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to be a general so he offered me up. His wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really happy if you become a general?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,me me me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to sow discord? You’re too naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the relationship between us brothers for more than 20 years is just paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here honestly and we will report to Master Quan now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait I’m really not a Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect these two people to be incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to escape quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What you said makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I secretly cut a little Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t shout
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, my simple brother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you do big things if you can’t resist this little temptation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You only want what you want, but you don’t care what I want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be a general
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to enjoy life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a happy Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn’t taken you with me all these years and been held back by you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have become a general long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a hopeless case—like trying to plaster mud onto a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re calling me a wall? I think you’re the one who’s a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare talk back? Looks like you’re overdue for a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve hated you for ages; I’ve always had to wear your hand-me-downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t stand you either—a new game console,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you broke it in just two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nephew, it’s time to take medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,drink slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.27,0:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, is there really no other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Apart from paying tribute to Bulala to appease the monster, there is currently no better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Golden Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find the legendary Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we defeat the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s fake. There is no Golden Bulala in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t my father become the king just because he found the Golden Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If he really had the Golden Bulala, he wouldn’t have been defeated by the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to keep going like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re not feeling well these days, don’t worry about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have a good rest. I will go out and be busy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any other ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.61,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Will something happen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see if you are hurt. Where does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you turned into a stuffed doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Weslie but I don’t know you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you lose your memory when you become Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.97,0:09:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bulala you are looking for looks like me and was captured by soldiers and taken to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I go to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace is very well guarded
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can enter the gate of Goats’ Village. What does it mean if it’s just the gate of the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to enter the important area of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s indeed a bit difficult, but it can’t stop me King Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to continue after failing so many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course because he is my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over. Where is the water? Put out the fire quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you guard the warehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the hard work of the residents for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you afford them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,who did this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was that Bulala named Weslie who did it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He provoked the two of us to secretly untie the rope and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He also set fire to the warehouse
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue to let him go on like this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even our entire palace was destroyed by him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone come and catch him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
